  {
   "id": "s2",
   "title": "Deccan Herald, 16 December 2025, reporting the Chief Electoral Officer's statement on the draft roll",
   "date": "2025-12-16",
   "primary": false
  }
 ],
 "notes": [
  "The roll before, the draft, the names added and removed after it and the final roll come from the Chief Electoral Officer's press release of 14 February 2026, posted on the office's own account. The reasons for the names left off come from the Chief Electoral Officer's statement of 16 December 2025 as three newspapers reported it.",
  "The newspapers give 80,645 shifted or absent and 2,024 duplicates, which add with the 20,798 dead to the 1,03,467 left off. The Chief Electoral Officer's own post of that day prints 80,615 and 2,100, which come to 46 more, so the newspapers' figures are used.",
  "The 42,719 names added after the draft are 41,492 on Forms 6, 6A and 8 from within the union territory and 1,227 on Form 8 from electors who moved in from other states.",
  "The 16,619 names removed after the draft are 858 on Form 7 and 15,761 removed for shifting or on verification during the revision. Changes of recorded gender moved six men and four women between the counts and add nothing overall.",
  "The constituency table is from the annexure, and every row and every region, district and state total adds up.",
  "The four regions are Puducherry, Karaikal, Mahe and Yanam. Mahe and Yanam belong to Puducherry district, so the union territory's two districts are Puducherry with 7,88,696 electors and Karaikal with 1,55,515."
 ],
 "cannot_show": [
  "How many names were left off in each constituency or region. The Chief Electoral Officer published the roll before and the draft for the union territory only.",
  "The names left off by district. Newspapers gave a split of 85,531 and 17,936 but labelled the second group differently, as Karaikal in one paper and as Mahe and Yanam in another, so it is left out.",
  "Women's share of the names left off. The roll before was not published by sex.",
  "How many notices were sent. No count was found. The Chief Electoral Officer said on draft day that about 71,500 electors on the draft could not be linked to an earlier revision and would need a document.",
  "How many of the names added after the draft were people left off it."
 ]
}
